{"5133900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Can 'Em All","steam_appid":5133900,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5364590],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh look, the truck is here.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truck delivers a fresh batch of adorable creatures straight to your factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately for them, they're also your main source of income.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First, you need them dead.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapons and clear out the factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now turn them into something useful.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the bodies  and throw them into the crusher.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get those cans into the tube.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your freshly processed cans still need to be sold.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reinvest in the business.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger weapons. Upgrade your vacuum. Unlock machines. Build conveyors. Increase production. Bring in more creatures. Automate the factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh look, the truck is here.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truck delivers a fresh batch of adorable creatures straight to your factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately for them, they're also your main source of income.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First, you need them dead.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapons and clear out the factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now turn them into something useful.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the bodies  and throw them into the crusher.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get those cans into the tube.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your freshly processed cans still need to be sold.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reinvest in the business.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger weapons. Upgrade your vacuum. Unlock machines. Build conveyors. Increase production. Bring in more creatures. Automate the factory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.poster.avif?t=1793308713\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.webm?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/extras\/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.mp4?t=1793308713\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A juicy first-person incremental game about turning cute creatures into cans. Kill them, collect their bodies, can them, and sell them. Make money, upgrade your weapons and machines, and produce more and more.","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/19aa14ebe3720e02f7f8c720abbf9749cf36967f\/header.jpg?t=1793308713","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/55ae6cf095c2b9ac862baf83bdcad69d1f263a62\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793308713","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5133900\/55ae6cf095c2b9ac862baf83bdcad69d1f263a62\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793308713","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 \/ Intel Core i3-7100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> AMD Radeon RX 460 \/ NVIDIA GTX 950<